# Few-shot prompt for a custom internal framework:
'Generate API route definitions for our custom framework. Here are 2 examples:

Example 1 — GET route:
@Route({ method: "GET", path: "/users/:id", auth: "required", roles: ["admin", "user"] })
async getUser(ctx: AppContext): Promise<UserDTO> {
  return UserService.findById(ctx.params.id, ctx.user);
}

Example 2 — POST route:
@Route({ method: "POST", path: "/orders", auth: "required", validate: CreateOrderSchema })
async createOrder(ctx: AppContext): Promise<OrderDTO> {
  return OrderService.create(ctx.body, ctx.user);
}

Now generate routes for: list all products, get product by ID, create product (admin only)'
